<span id="S3.T1.5.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Term/phrase selection, PRF in embedding space; robust disambiguation; efficient reranking</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.2.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
