<span id="S3.T1.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Encoder–Decoder </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(BART, T5) </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib54" title="" class="ltx_ref">Lewis et al., 2019</a>; <a href="#bib.bib90" title="" class="ltx_ref">Raffel et al., 2019</a><span id="S3.T1.5.3.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:72.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Denoising/text-to-text seq2seq; encoder+decoder</span></span>
</span></td>
