<span id="S3.T1.5.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Structured generative QE: </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.3.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">pseudo-docs, titles, rationales;</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.3.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">promptable output control</span></span>
