<span id="S3.T1.5.3.4.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Decoding latency;</span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S3.T1.5.3.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">quality control of generations</span></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="S3.T1.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S3.T1.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:72.5pt;">
<span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Decoder-only LLM </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(GPT-3/4, PaLM, LLaMA) </span>
<br class="ltx_break"><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1.1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib28" title="" class="ltx_ref">Floridi and Chiriatti, 2020</a>; <a href="#bib.bib4" title="" class="ltx_ref">Achiam et al., 2023</a>; <a href="#bib.bib5" title="" class="ltx_ref">Anil et al., 2023</a><span id="S3.T1.5.4.1.1.1.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
