<span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Autoregressive LM at scale; in-context learning </span><cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep"><span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(</span><a href="#bib.bib113" title="" class="ltx_ref">Wei et al., 2022</a><span id="S3.T1.5.4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">)</span></cite></span>
</span></td>
<td id="S3.T1.5.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top" style="padding-top:0.9pt;padding-bottom:0.9pt;">
